  that code must not be copied, derived from, or referenced.

  Update procedure:
    gh api repos/flydev-fr/mormot.ai/commits/HEAD --jq .sha        # their new HEAD
    git -C <clone> diff <pinned-sha>..<new-sha> -- mormot2-pgvector # what changed
    # port relevant changes, then update Commit/Date above in the same commit.

